2026-04-05 04:58:09.468 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 File Manager & Source Core\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming and state integrity across the Source Manager, Upload Manager, and Intelligence Analyst components.\n\n## 1. SourceManager.tsx\n- **Standardization**: Replace `Date.now()` with `randomId()` for external context nodes.\n- **Type Safety**: Refactor `onUpdateText` to remove `as any` and use a type-safe mapping pass.\n- **Guarded Mutations**: Add `if (!project || !updateProject) return` to all handlers (`removeContext`, `updateContextType`, `onAddText`).\n- **Persistence Error Handling**: Wrap `updateProject` calls in `try-catch` blocks with error logging.\n\n## 2. UploadManager.tsx\n- **Standardization**: Replace `uuidv4()` with `randomId()` for consistency.\n- **Robust Ingestion**: Wrap `FileReader` operations in `try-catch` blocks and implement a global \"Ingestion Aborted\" state for batch failures.\n- **Atomic Batches**: Refactor `onDrop` to avoid multiple rapid `updateProject` calls by batching file ingestion where possible.\n- **HUD Consistency**: Align the `ContextInspectorHUD` with the standardized \"Intelligence Suite\" dialog patterns.\n\n## 3. IntelligenceAnalyst.tsx\n- **Containment**: Add an error boundary for the dynamic `ReactJson` component.\n- **Validation**: Harden the `analysisSchema` and add defensive checks for empty or malformed JSON payloads.\n- **Visual Feedback**: Add a \"Neural Processing\" pulse to the analysis trigger button.\n\n## 4. FileNodeItem.tsx\n- **Defensive Rendering**: Add checks for missing metadata and ensure the `sizeInKb` calculation handles `null` or `undefined` content safely.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/file-manager/SourceManager.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/file-manager/UploadManager.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-cont