2026-04-05 05:07:31.067 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 Outline & Navigator Core\n\nThis plan standardizes structural integrity and defensive programming across the Outline Navigator system.\n\n## 1. useOutlineOperations.ts\n- **Standardization**: Replace all `uuidv4()` occurrences with the project-standard `randomId()`.\n- **Guarded Mutations**: Add `if (!project || !updateProject) return` to all handlers (`handleMoveItem`, `handleUpdateTitle`, `handleDeleteItem`, `handleAddChapter`, etc.).\n- **Containment**: Wrap `handlePasteItem` and `handleDuplicateItem` in `try-catch` blocks with error logging.\n- **Atomic Reliability**: Ensure structural transformations (like `splice` or `addSection`) are performed on a safe clone of the project content within the `updateProject` callback.\n\n## 2. SidebarOutlineManager.tsx\n- **Dnd-Kit Safety**: Implement defensive validation in `onDragEnd` to verify node existence before triggering move operations.\n- **Search Resilience**: Harden search filtering to handle null titles and malformed project structures gracefully.\n- **Visual Consistency**: Add technical metadata pulses and the standardized \"Stable Manifest\" footer.\n\n## 3. SortableOutlineItem.tsx\n- **Defensive Rendering**: Add guards for missing IDs and ensure the section count badge handles `undefined` section lists safely.\n- **Edit Validation**: Add title length and whitespace validation to `onBlur` before committing title changes.\n- **UX Safety**: Implement `try-catch` for focus management and edit-mode transitions.\n\n## 4. State Synchronization\n- **Integrity**: Ensure structural deletions trigger a \"Selection Recovery\" sweep in the parent workspace (e.g., clearing `activeChapterId` if the chapter is removed).\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/useOutlineOperations.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/SidebarOutlineManager.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/SortableOutlineItem.tsx`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_c9b494922b5f4100909086d4b543c59c", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
