p-based IDs.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Coding Conventions & UI Standards\n+*   **TypeScript**: Zero tolerance for `any`. Use `unknown` with narrowing. Use explicit `instanceof` guards for Chapter/Section entities during rendering.\n+*   **Components**: Use `React.memo` for high-frequency workspace components. Default to Server Components.\n+*   **Styling**: Technical \"Intelligence Suite\" aesthetic: 28px dot-grids, technical high-density labels (`text-[10px]`, `font-black`, `uppercase`), and \"Stable Manifest\" footers.\n+*   **State**: Zustand for document orchestration; TanStack Query for server-side metadata.\n+*   **API**: Standardize responses using `handle*Result` helpers in `src/infrastructure/api/api-utils.ts`.\n \n ---\n \n", "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_ec17b5e3b17e426593e4ab355511f745", "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-04-05T06:21:05.758035+00:00", "part_kind": "tool-return"}
