2026-04-05 06:48:18.019 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 User & Billing Modules\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming and state integrity across the User Profile, Authentication, and Billing modules.\n\n## 1. Profile & Security Hardening\n- **UpdateProfileForm.tsx**: Add existence guards for `userProfile`. Implement try-catch for the submission vector. Standardize the \"Neural Matrix\" loading pulse.\n- **SecuritySettingsForm.tsx**: Refactor `handleToggleAlerts` to use a more robust optimistic update pattern. Ensure `userProfile.id` is validated before API transmission.\n\n## 2. Billing & Credit Acquisition\n- **PurchaseCreditsDialog.tsx**:\n  - Harden the multi-step state transitions.\n  - Implement defensive validation for the payment proof (size/type checks).\n  - Wrap `FormData` synthesis and mutation triggers in try-catch blocks.\n  - Standardize \"Settlement Node\" error states if public settings fail to load.\n\n## 3. Auth Pipeline\n- **SignupForm.tsx**: Secure the async `generateFingerprint` call with try-catch. Ensure the mutation trigger is guarded against fingerprinting failures. Standardize the \"Auth Node\" visual indicators.\n\n## 4. Admin Management Consoles\n- **UserManagementConsole.tsx**: Standardize the \"Directory Error\" fallback. Add high-fidelity empty states if no records are found.\n- **PaymentVerificationConsole.tsx**: Harden the \"Live Ledger\" tabs. Ensure transaction list filtering handles null/malformed data gracefully.\n\n## 5. Visual Consistency\n- Align all footers with \"Auth Node\" and \"Financial Engine\" stable version manifests.\n- Standardize technical typography and 28px dot-grid backgrounds where appropriate.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/app/profile/UpdateProfileForm.tsx`\n- `src/app/profile/SecuritySettingsForm.tsx`\n- `src/modules/billing/adapters/components/pricing/PurchaseCreditsDialog.tsx`\n- `src/modules/