2026-04-05 07:12:39.350 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 AI Flow Infrastructure\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming, input validation, and output sanitization across the core AI generation flows.\n\n## 1. Core Logic Hardening\n- **Standardization**: Enforce the use of `MODEL_BY_TASK` constants for all AI calls to ensure model consistency.\n- **Sanitization**: Integrate the `cleanAiOutput` utility across all flows to strip conversational filler and markdown artifacts from model responses.\n- **Validation**: Implement strict `inputSchema.safeParse()` checks at the entry point of every flow to catch malformed data from the UI.\n\n## 2. generate-report-section.ts & generate-chapter-content.ts\n- **Containment**: Wrap AI generation calls in `try-catch` blocks.\n- **Feedback**: Implement structured `Result<T, E>` return types to provide high-fidelity error context to the HUD panels.\n- **Guard**: Add checks for empty or whitespace-only context payloads to prevent unnecessary neural compute.\n\n## 3. manipulate-text.ts\n- **Type Safety**: Replace all `any` casts with strict schema types.\n- **Constraint**: Add a \"Command Vector\" validation to ensure the manipulation instruction is substantive.\n\n## 4. project-report-generator.ts\n- **Tool Resilience**: Add existence guards for all multi-step tool outputs (`calculateProjectMetrics`, `analyzeGitHistory`).\n- **Telemetry**: Transition from `console.log` to a more robust internal tracing pattern.\n\n## 5. Visual/Documentation Consistency\n- Add high-fidelity comments to each flow file explaining the \"Neural Buffer\" logic and validation steps.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/generation/generate-report-section.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/generation/generate-chapter-content.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/writing/manipulate-text.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/document/project-report-generator.ts`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_a2c677420f934523947a670a321c60da", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
