2026-04-05 07:24:32.303 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 Admin Oversight & Notifications\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming and state integrity across the Administrative Dashboard, Global Settings, and the Notification Signal Center.\n\n## 1. Notification Center Hardening\n- **NotificationDropdown.tsx**:\n  - Remove all `any` casts and implement strict `Notification` domain typing.\n  - Wrap `formatDistanceToNow` in a robust `try-catch` block to handle malformed timestamps.\n  - Standardize the \"Signal Hub\" visual indicators and empty states.\n- **BatchNotificationDialog.tsx**:\n  - Add existence guards for the global user matrix before performing batch operations.\n  - Wrap the dispatch mutation in a `try-catch` containment block with toast feedback.\n\n## 2. Global Settings Manifest\n- **AdminSettingsPage.tsx**:\n  - Transition the settings update pipeline to return a structured `Result<AppSettings, Error>`.\n  - Implement an atomic mapping pass for nested payment method configurations.\n  - Refactor the form lifecycle to handle refetch synchronization without data loss.\n  - Standardize the \"Matrix Configuration\" technical typography.\n\n## 3. Analytics & Dashboard Resilience\n- **Dashboard.tsx & Sub-modules**:\n  - Implement defensive data mapping for Recharts/TanStack Table integrations.\n  - Add \"Node Connection Failure\" fallbacks for chart data fetching.\n  - Align all dashboard widgets with the 28px dot-grid and glassmorphism standards.\n\n## 4. Visual Consistency\n- Align all footers with \"System Oversight\" and \"Signal Hub\" stable version manifests.\n- Standardize technical labels and neural pulse triggers.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/components/shared/NotificationDropdown.tsx`\n- `src/modules/admin/adapters/components/dashboard/BatchNotificationDialog.tsx`\n- `src/app/admin/settings/page.tsx`\n- `src/modules/admin/adapters/components/dashboard/Dashboard.tsx` (and related widgets)\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_be5fe999fefb4f8386f180e8c9259150", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
