2026-04-05 07:36:23.744 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 Document Export Engine\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming, error containment, and output sanitization across the DOCX and PPTX production pipelines.\n\n## 1. Service Layer Hardening\n- **DocxExportService.ts & PptxExportService.ts**:\n  - Transition return types to `Result<Blob | Buffer, Error>` to provide high-fidelity failure vectors.\n  - Implement top-level `try-catch` containment around the full export lifecycle.\n  - Standardize model-to-markdown conversion with a mandatory `cleanAiOutput` sanitization pass.\n\n## 2. DOCX Pipeline (Word)\n- **MarkdownToWordConverter.ts**:\n  - Add existence guards for `project` metadata during cover page synthesis.\n  - Implement defensive validation for `selectedContent` to prevent mapping over null/corrupted nodes.\n  - Wrap the `docx` library's `Packer.toBuffer` call in a containment block.\n\n## 3. PPTX Pipeline (PowerPoint)\n- **PptxExportService.ts**:\n  - Encapsulate the complex footnote extraction logic into a tested, safe utility.\n  - Standardize `as any` casts with explicit type guards for styles and layouts.\n- **markdown-to-pptx-converter.ts**:\n  - Add existence guards for the `styles` manifest and handle missing template keys gracefully.\n  - Wrap the `remark/rehype` AST transformation pipeline in a `try-catch` block.\n\n## 4. Visual/UX Synchronization\n- Ensure the `ExportHUD` correctly consumes the new `Result` objects to trigger localized \"Production Failed\" error states.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai-content/infrastructure/exporters/DocxExportService.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/infrastructure/exporters/PptxExportService.ts`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/infrastructure/exporters/MarkdownToWordConverter.ts`\n- `src/modules/templates/infrastructure/exporters/pptx/markdown-to-pptx-converter.ts`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_0dfe8cda9c25419c9cf8bccfdbfbe687", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
