ming and existence guards.\\n  49 ✅ **Next.js 15 Compliance**: Resolved Rules of Hooks violations and standardized hook placement across the builder.\\n  50 ✅ **Atomic State Hardening**: Implemented atomic transformations for complex multi-node operations.\\n  51 ✅ **Error Containment**: Introduced localized Error Boundaries and persistence containment (`try-catch`) project-wide.\\n  52 ✅ **Structural Integrity**: Standardized the `randomId()` utility and selection recovery logic.\\n  53 \\n  54 ### Phase 8: Scaling & Optimization (Current Focus)\\n  55 ✅ **AI Resilience Enhancement**: Implemented tiered model fallback and request timeouts for 8GB RAM stability.\\n  56 ✅ **Domain Entity Standardization**: Unified all domain entities on the `toProperties()` and `withProps()` pattern.\\n  57 ✅ **Client-Server SDK Decoupling**: Resolved critical bundling errors by isolating heavy AI SDKs from the browser.\\n  58 - 🔄 **Test Coverage Expansion**: Increase unit and integration test coverage to 40%+.\\n  59 - 🔄 **Performance Monitoring**: Implement real-time monitoring.\\n  60 - 🔄 **RAG Retrieval Optimization**: Implement hybrid search and reranking improvements.\\n  61 - 🔄 **UI Performance**: Further optimize React rendering for the editor.\\n  62 - 🔄 **Mobile Experience Refinement**: Optimize the 3-zone architecture for smaller touch devices.\\n  63 \\n  64 \\n  65 ## Feature Completion Status\\n  66 \\n  67 ### Writing Tools (23/23 - 100% Complete)\\n  68 ✅ All core writing tools are operational.\\n  69 \\n  70 ### Document Features (100% Complete)\\n  71 ✅ Report Generation, Presentation Builder, Document Export.\\n  72 \\n  73 ### RAG System (100% Complete)\\n  74 ✅ Semantic Search, Context-Aware Generation, Knowledge Base.\\n  75 \\n  76 ### Platform Features (100% Complete)\\n  77 ✅ User Authentication, Payment Processing, Multi-language Support, Admin Dashboard.\\n  78 ✅ **AI Project Consultant Chat**: In-app conversational AI to assist with project development.\\n